                      "code": "PROVIDER_TIMEOUT_AMBIGUOUS",
                      "messages": [
                        "Provider ZOOP, onboarding 3f6c1a2e-8b4d-4c7e-9a1f-5d2e7b9c0a14: UNKNOWN.",
                        "The provider did not confirm this bank update. Inspect the provider account before retrying; untrusted provider diagnostics were omitted.",
